## Tecnologías usadas

### Backend

- .NET 8
- ASP.NET Core Web API
- Entity Framework Core
- SQL Server
- JWT Bearer Authentication
- BCrypt.Net
- Swagger / OpenAPI

### Frontend

- React
- Vite
- React Router
- Axios
- React Hook Form
